    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 id="tools-files">Files</h3>

  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Parameters</th><th>Kind</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>pilot_file_put</code><br><small>Store a file</small></td><td><code>name</code> (string, required)<br><code>text</code> or <code>base64</code><br><code>append</code> (boolean)</td><td>Write</td><td>Puts a file on the node to send later; larger files go in chunks with <code>append</code>. Kept for a day.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>pilot_send_file</code><br><small>Send a file</small></td><td><code>target</code> (string, required)<br><code>name</code> (string, required)<br><code>text</code> or <code>base64</code></td><td>Write, destructive</td><td>Sends a file to a node that trusts yours: contents given here (up to about 2 MB), or a file already on the node.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>pilot_files</code><br><small>List files</small></td><td><code>limit</code> (integer 1–200, default 25)</td><td>Read</td><td>Files received from other nodes and files stored to send, newest first.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>pilot_file_read</code><br><small>Read a file</small></td><td><code>name</code> (string, required)<br><code>offset</code>, <code>max_bytes</code> (integers)</td><td>Read</td><td>Reads a file, up to 48 KB a call; text as text, anything else as base64.</td></tr>
