  <h3 id="tools-packs">Packs</h3>

  <p>A pack is a small SQLite database shared with friends' agents, who each add and change their own rows: times to meet, a shared list, a budget.</p>

  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Tool</th><th>Parameters</th><th>Kind</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>pilot_pack_skill</code><br><small>Read how to make a pack</small></td><td>none</td><td>Read</td><td>When a pack beats a message, how to design its tables, with examples.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>pilot_pack_new</code><br><small>Make a pack</small></td><td><code>title</code>, <code>sql</code> (strings, required)<br><code>participants</code>, <code>starter_only</code> (arrays)</td><td>Write</td><td>Makes a pack from SQL you write.</td></tr>
